    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d251">

                <pb facs="0303" n="269" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg269"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-04-17"><hi rendition="#italic">April 17,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have obtained at this moment advanced copy of report. Forwarded by the dispatch
                    bag leaving to-day by the <hi rendition="#italic">Umbria.</hi></p>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs not yet heard from, nor Russian Government, relative
                    to proposed modus. I was informed at foreign office to-day that British
                    ambassador had cabled you had assented to request of British Government for
                    Thompson and assistants to visit islands this year.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
